toastsaver (1.4.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * New VOLCANO saver: an undersea volcano that grows into an island. Magma
    rises from deep below into a chamber, breaks a winding channel up to the
    surface and erupts, with the lava cooling into rock that builds the
    mountain. Waves roll in, the sea douses the lava, and every so often a
    whale swims by. When the mountain is tall it blows itself apart with a
    tsunami, and a new seamount begins.
  * BIRDS: bees and ladybugs visit the flowers alongside the butterflies.
  * The picker lays out all the previews at the screen's own shape, so they
    are bigger and easier to read at any resolution.
  * With --windowed, clicks and keys no longer quit: S takes a screenshot,
    Space pauses, [ and ] (or the slider) change the speed, R restarts,
    E shows an easter egg, I shows what the saver is doing.

 -- piyh <10518137+piyh@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:29:04 +0000

toastsaver (1.3.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * FISH has new friends: a shark swims by now and then (and the little
    fish dart out of its way), plus a sea turtle, jellyfish, a crab on
    the sand, an angelfish, coral and starfish. The fish are shaded and
    a few hazy ones swim far in the back.
  * Updates arrive with a plain apt upgrade; the extra update timer and
    the USB stick installer scripts are gone.
  * From source is now just make && sudo make install.

 -- piyh <10518137+piyh@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:20:58 +0000

toastsaver (1.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * One app: you always start by picking a screensaver, and the gear in
    the corner opens the rest of the settings in the same window. One
    menu entry instead of two.
  * Save power: savers draw at 30 frames a second by default (FPS=30);
    switch it off in settings or set FPS=0 to follow the display.
  * DICE uses about 5x less CPU per frame, with the same picture.
  * toastsaver --bench SAVER|all prints how long each saver takes per
    frame on this machine.
  * The macOS preview opens the same app with the same settings file.

 -- piyh <10518137+piyh@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:41:02 +0000

toastsaver (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * New screensavers: RAINBOW (the Waffle Cat flies on a rainbow),
    BOOKS (books fly off a cozy shelf and open to little moving
    pictures), DICE (a felt dice tray with a chalkboard tally) and
    BIRDS (songbirds over summer hills).
  * SURPRISE ME picks from a mix you choose in the picker
    (RANDOM_SAVERS in the config file).
  * LAVA rewritten: wax that warms, rises, cools and sinks inside a
    glowing glass lamp.
  * The picker grows to four columns to fit twelve savers.

